# Trivy CVE exceptions for orkyo-community
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # Impact | Reason | Added: YYYY-MM-DD | Review: YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Policy: time-bound only. Review date must be within 14 days of added date.
# Remove entries once the upstream fix is available.

# ── nginx:1.30-alpine — libexpat 2.8.2-r0 not yet in any published nginx image ──
# All nginx-alpine lines (1.30/1.31/mainline, Alpine 3.23) still ship libexpat
# 2.8.1-r0 (verified across tags 2026-07-09). nginx serves static assets only and
# parses no attacker-supplied XML via libexpat here. (Re-reviewed 2026-07-25.)
CVE-2026-56131  # HIGH | libexpat <2.8.2 handler call depth (DoS) | upstream nginx-alpine not yet rebuilt with 2.8.2-r0 | Added: 2026-07-09 | Review: 2026-08-08
CVE-2026-56407  # HIGH | libexpat <2.8.2 integer overflow doProlog | upstream nginx-alpine not yet rebuilt with 2.8.2-r0 | Added: 2026-07-09 | Review: 2026-08-08
CVE-2026-56408  # HIGH | libexpat <2.8.2 integer overflow copyString | upstream nginx-alpine not yet rebuilt with 2.8.2-r0 | Added: 2026-07-09 | Review: 2026-08-08

# ── Keycloak 26.6.4 — jackson-databind 2.21.4 not shipped by upstream ─────────
# Upstream KC 26.6 line has no patch release (26.6.5+ does not exist; 26.7.0 is
# a minor upgrade needing its own validation — tracked separately). The affected
# deserialization sits in KC's own jars; no Orkyo-controlled input path.
CVE-2026-54512  # HIGH | jackson-databind PolymorphicTypeValidator bypass (RCE) in upstream keycloak 26.6.4 jars | no upstream 26.6.x patch; KC 26.7 upgrade tracked separately | Added: 2026-07-09 | Review: 2026-08-08
CVE-2026-54513  # HIGH | jackson-databind security bypass (RCE) in upstream keycloak 26.6.4 jars | no upstream 26.6.x patch; KC 26.7 upgrade tracked separately | Added: 2026-07-09 | Review: 2026-08-08
CVE-2026-40983  # HIGH | micrometer-core DoS in upstream keycloak 26.6.4 jars (fix 1.16.6/1.15.12 ships with a KC bump) | no upstream 26.6.x patch; KC 26.7 upgrade tracked separately | Added: 2026-08-07 | Review: 2026-09-07
CVE-2026-40984  # HIGH | micrometer-core/jetty DoS sibling of 40983 in upstream keycloak 26.6.4 jars | no upstream 26.6.x patch; KC 26.7 upgrade tracked separately | Added: 2026-08-07 | Review: 2026-09-07

